FEED The window bars are bent inward, not out.
FEED Mourncoil rises. Frost comes off it in sheets.
FEED Breath steams. Then the steam freezes.
FEED Somewhere below, a bell with no clapper rings once. The dungeon is one floor deeper than it was.
FEED The last lantern gutters out. They are fighting blind.
FEED BigAxe the barbarian falls on floor 10 to the dark below. Level 1, 1 kills. !reroll to rise again.
